WEBVTT

00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:14.670
There's the Subway!

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:43.460
It left.

00:00:43.570 --> 00:00:45.130
What do we do now?

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:49.570
I can't believe this!

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:50.610
Are you sure?!

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:52.840
Is the little guy saying something?

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:57.950
He says he has no idea when
the train will come again.

00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:03.050
It could come tomorrow, or in a month,

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:07.600
or in a year, or it could be a lot later than that.

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:10.030
So I guess we can't count on it then.

00:01:36.390 --> 00:01:42.190
The light of dawn pours over the vast Earth

00:01:36.390 --> 00:01:42.190
Daichi ni sosogu yoake

00:01:44.070 --> 00:01:49.700
And marks the beginning of our journey

00:01:44.070 --> 00:01:49.700
Tabidatsu toki wo tsugeru

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:58.810
With our eyes on the future

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:58.810
Mirai wo mezashi kaketeyuku kaze

00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:04.910
I deeply breathe in the rushing wind

00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:04.910
Kono mune ni suikonda

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:14.550
The eyes that could only speak in dreams

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:14.550
Yume dake wo kizamitsuketa hitomi

00:02:16.430 --> 00:02:22.060
Presented us with the path we're to take

00:02:16.430 --> 00:02:22.060
Bokura ni yuku michi wo ataeru

00:02:23.970 --> 00:02:27.770
Fly to the Neverland

00:02:23.970 --> 00:02:27.770
Fly to the Neverland

00:02:27.840 --> 00:02:37.270
Awaken the unlimited courage inside of us

00:02:27.840 --> 00:02:37.270
Kagiri nai yuuki wo mezamesasete

00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:46.650
The overflowing fruit...

00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:50.860
Those living in Wonderland...

00:02:52.700 --> 00:02:55.600
Despair... despair...

00:02:56.370 --> 00:02:57.900
Despair...

00:02:59.140 --> 00:03:01.230
The one who spreads pollen...

00:03:04.510 --> 00:03:06.240
And the frozen flowers...

00:03:11.520 --> 00:03:14.450
Welcome to the night of Wonderland.

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:19.620
I am Fabula, your guide.

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:25.700
He's getting closer, together with the mist.

00:03:43.380 --> 00:03:46.380
We didn't make the train. What do we do now?

00:03:46.490 --> 00:03:48.390
I can't believe this!

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:50.050
This really worries me.

00:04:13.050 --> 00:04:15.950
That thief!

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:33.600
Thief? What is that? Can you eat it?

00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:35.690
A thief is what you are!

00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:37.900
You're the one who stole my
backpack, aren't you?!

00:04:38.010 --> 00:04:41.340
In my world, that was a normal thing to do.

00:04:41.440 --> 00:04:44.780
I don't care. Just give it back to me!

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:46.610
I already ate it.

00:04:47.980 --> 00:04:49.750
There was a lot more in there than food.

00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:52.710
I boiled and fried it right, so it was edible.

00:04:54.190 --> 00:04:57.320
Hey, I don't suppose you know
anything about the Subway?

00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:04.300
This place is all I really know,
but if you ask the other guys...

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:05.420
Other...

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:07.060
Guys?

00:05:07.170 --> 00:05:08.360
Where are they?

00:05:17.910 --> 00:05:20.510
Hey you, how far down are we going?

00:05:22.350 --> 00:05:26.580
My name is Fungo. Don't forget it.

00:05:26.690 --> 00:05:29.280
Fungo? That's a weird name.

00:05:46.570 --> 00:05:47.510
Wow!

00:05:47.940 --> 00:05:49.380
Are they training for something?

00:05:49.810 --> 00:05:52.610
This is our organization.

00:05:52.710 --> 00:05:54.200
Organization?

00:05:54.320 --> 00:05:58.580
Our leader said we're trying to make
something in Wonderland,

00:05:58.690 --> 00:06:01.290
but I don't know much about that.

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:04.730
We're to establish order
in Wonderland, right?

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:06.690
Leader!

00:06:06.790 --> 00:06:10.030
Welcome to our underground
organization, the Comodeen,

00:06:10.030 --> 00:06:12.100
the only place of order
in all of Wonderland.

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:14.000
I am the leader, Knave.

00:06:21.840 --> 00:06:23.310
Where is he?

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:27.270
My thanks.

00:06:31.020 --> 00:06:33.290
You'll have to forgive Fungo for being rude.

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:36.520
It has not been very long since he
was lost here in Wonderland.

00:06:36.620 --> 00:06:40.580
It seems his world too was destroyed
because of Chaos.

00:06:41.200 --> 00:06:42.630
Destroyed?

00:06:42.630 --> 00:06:44.030
What exactly do you mean by Chaos?

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:49.060
We are preparing for the upcoming battle
so that we may know the true shape of Chaos.

00:06:50.370 --> 00:06:53.970
I've heard that Wonderland is
under the control of the Earl.

00:06:54.110 --> 00:06:57.480
But who is he? What is Chaos?

00:06:57.580 --> 00:07:01.520
We are fighting so other worlds
do not meet the same fate as ours.

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:04.640
We, the Comodeen, are going
to establish order here.

00:07:06.020 --> 00:07:08.180
You're different than those guys
who live above, aren't you?

00:07:09.320 --> 00:07:13.230
I prefer you not classify us with those
people of despair from above ground.

00:07:13.630 --> 00:07:17.460
I can tell from your eyes that you
know nothing of despair.

00:07:18.070 --> 00:07:20.090
Why don't you fight at our side?

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:23.000
I, well...

00:07:24.440 --> 00:07:26.430
Hey, check me out, Lisa!

00:07:26.540 --> 00:07:29.310
How is it? You think it's cute?

00:07:30.480 --> 00:07:34.380
It's been so long since I've heIped
a little girl change her clothes.

00:07:35.380 --> 00:07:39.150
It looks just great on you, Ai! So cute!

00:07:42.160 --> 00:07:44.220
Hey Sis, you changed clothes!

00:07:45.330 --> 00:07:46.920
Isn't it nice?!

00:07:47.030 --> 00:07:49.590
It isn't fair that only you get to change, Sis!

00:07:53.300 --> 00:07:55.700
He said that freshly washed hair tastes good.

00:07:56.270 --> 00:07:58.670
I see you choose family peace
over worldwide crisis.

00:07:59.940 --> 00:08:03.500
They came all the way to Wonderland to
search for their parents, didn't they?

00:08:04.450 --> 00:08:08.470
Family is more important to these kids
than anything else in the world.

00:08:08.580 --> 00:08:10.570
And there is nothing that is important to you?

00:08:14.820 --> 00:08:15.950
I understand.

00:08:16.860 --> 00:08:20.520
We here will keep our eyes open
for their parents too.

00:08:24.300 --> 00:08:25.320
Kaze!

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:27.630
Mister Windmill...

00:08:40.550 --> 00:08:43.240
This bavarois is delicious!

00:08:43.890 --> 00:08:45.480
The sauce is really good.

00:08:45.590 --> 00:08:50.490
It is made of wasteful effort and fading dreams.

00:08:51.990 --> 00:08:53.860
Man, I want to eat this again.

00:08:54.930 --> 00:08:57.230
I shall tell the patissier.

00:08:58.230 --> 00:09:00.030
Back to business,

00:09:00.030 --> 00:09:01.560
about this underground organization...

00:09:02.370 --> 00:09:04.810
It's those annoying ingrates, right?

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:09.800
The underground organization wants to
bring about order in Wonderland, but...

00:09:11.210 --> 00:09:15.380
That is where my Magun baby
slipped off to, isn't it?

00:09:16.480 --> 00:09:18.510
What idiocy!

00:09:18.990 --> 00:09:21.650
Only God can create order.

00:09:21.760 --> 00:09:26.280
And that means me, right?!
They don't know anything!

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:33.590
Shall I take out the Black Wind and
the others in one fell swoop?

00:09:34.700 --> 00:09:39.570
You're too late! Makenshi is
already on his way there.

00:09:39.670 --> 00:09:43.800
Yeah, and getting yourself turned small and
coming back like this is really dorky of you!

00:09:46.050 --> 00:09:49.240
Can you ever forgive me, Your Excellency?

00:09:53.690 --> 00:09:54.780
Mister?

00:09:54.890 --> 00:09:56.050
Kaze!

00:09:57.730 --> 00:09:59.190
Is he an acquaintance of yours?

00:09:59.190 --> 00:10:01.290
He just wandered in here.

00:10:02.100 --> 00:10:06.000
Does that guy agree with
the goal of the Comodeen,

00:10:06.100 --> 00:10:09.330
to establish order in Wonderland?

00:10:09.770 --> 00:10:13.570
Since he's here, I certainly hope so.

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:16.070
I'd be happy if he did.

00:10:16.810 --> 00:10:20.010
I could never tell what he was thinking.

00:10:20.620 --> 00:10:23.380
But I know he's looking for someone.

00:10:23.990 --> 00:10:25.710
Just like you guys?

00:10:26.320 --> 00:10:28.310
What a nice weapon!

00:10:28.420 --> 00:10:32.360
So interesting! lt would be great
if we had stuff like this here!

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:35.120
You think you could make one too?

00:10:35.560 --> 00:10:37.190
I'd like to try.

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:39.630
Here you go, thank you.

00:10:43.300 --> 00:10:44.400
What is that?

00:10:45.170 --> 00:10:46.270
The Magun.

00:10:46.270 --> 00:10:50.040
Magun? Would you mind
if I took a closer look?

00:10:56.550 --> 00:10:58.040
It is my heart.

00:10:58.390 --> 00:11:00.510
Did you learn anything?

00:11:00.660 --> 00:11:04.020
Not quite. This one's going to take some time.

00:11:04.690 --> 00:11:07.290
So there is stuff that even you don't understand?

00:11:07.400 --> 00:11:09.590
The world is a big place, you know.

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:13.900
You helped us again, didn't you?

00:11:16.900 --> 00:11:22.600
You may not have intended to help us,
but these kids are really grateful to you.

00:11:23.310 --> 00:11:25.800
You're not even going to talk to them?

00:11:33.520 --> 00:11:35.750
You're alive, aren't you?!

00:11:51.110 --> 00:11:54.440
Hey, where did you guys get this thing?

00:11:54.540 --> 00:11:59.640
Where did we... It was just always
attached to Chocobo here.

00:11:59.750 --> 00:12:01.610
Do you know what it is?

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:03.940
I made it.

00:12:04.420 --> 00:12:05.750
What?!

00:12:06.250 --> 00:12:08.690
Look there, that's my logo.

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:11.950
A man I had never met asked me to make it.

00:12:12.390 --> 00:12:13.830
This is the Wonderland Watch, lsabelle.

00:12:14.260 --> 00:12:16.200
But it's strange!

00:12:16.300 --> 00:12:19.890
It looks like it's been heavily customized.

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:22.200
Who in the world put on all
of this unnecessary junk?

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:25.500
So do you also know a lot about the Subway?

00:12:25.610 --> 00:12:29.170
The Subway! Is that really running?

00:12:31.550 --> 00:12:34.910
We rode on the Subway to
first get to Wonderland.

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:37.280
To search for our Mom and Dad.

00:12:40.960 --> 00:12:44.820
Mister, you haven't seen them, have you?

00:12:44.930 --> 00:12:48.790
They supposedly came here on the Subway.

00:12:48.900 --> 00:12:50.960
But we're not sure where they are
in Wonderland.

00:12:52.170 --> 00:12:57.190
I'm so jealous! You guys rode the Subway.

00:12:58.110 --> 00:13:00.570
I want to ride it too!

00:13:07.880 --> 00:13:11.320
This chocobo has gotten like this
because of some weird pollen.

00:13:14.920 --> 00:13:17.890
It's been so long, Genevieve.

00:13:18.660 --> 00:13:19.820
What is that?

00:13:41.450 --> 00:13:44.040
No way! Is he healed?

00:13:46.020 --> 00:13:48.390
This is my all-purpose healing
machine, Genevieve.

00:13:48.490 --> 00:13:53.360
It uses a super-high frequency to
return muddled senses to normal.

00:13:53.460 --> 00:13:54.760
Amazing!

00:13:55.230 --> 00:13:58.200
You can always trust good ol' Cid the genius.

00:13:58.200 --> 00:14:01.900
There's nothing in the world that I can't make
and nothing I can't fix.

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:16.520
My thanks.

00:14:17.420 --> 00:14:19.390
I'll go on alone from here.

00:14:43.910 --> 00:14:45.210
An earthquake?

00:14:45.310 --> 00:14:47.910
It would be nice if it was
just an earthquake, but...

00:14:49.820 --> 00:14:50.910
Are you sure?

00:14:51.090 --> 00:14:53.990
He's saying that there's still time
to make it to the Subway.

00:14:54.320 --> 00:14:56.590
We can make it? But how?

00:14:56.590 --> 00:14:59.060
Yeah! Is he saying we have to run after it?

00:14:59.530 --> 00:15:02.120
Now I see. We can make it if
we can just catch up to it!

00:15:02.760 --> 00:15:04.320
I'll take you guys to it!

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:08.660
Personally, I want to see the Subway!
And ride it!

00:15:08.770 --> 00:15:11.200
Of course I'd love to help
you guys make it in time!

00:15:11.310 --> 00:15:12.860
Awesome!

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:14.960
Thanks, Cid!

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:18.700
Your mother and father are waiting
for you at the end of the line.

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:20.370
Isn't that right?

00:15:20.480 --> 00:15:22.850
That being the case, there's
nothing left to think about.

00:15:22.950 --> 00:15:26.650
If we don't get going, they'll be
far, far away in no time.

00:15:29.860 --> 00:15:31.880
You think that would be all right, Knave?

00:15:32.360 --> 00:15:35.120
Even if I did say no, you'd still go anyway.

00:15:35.560 --> 00:15:37.220
Wait a second, Cid.

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:41.130
Hey Lisa, why don't you ask
Knave about your boyfriend?

00:15:44.270 --> 00:15:45.400
Boyfriend?

00:15:46.340 --> 00:15:51.000
It seems that Lisa has come to Wonderland
in search of her sweetheart.

00:15:51.110 --> 00:15:53.910
Right?! You want to meet your boyfriend, right?

00:15:55.950 --> 00:16:00.190
Once you guys are united
safely with your parents,

00:16:00.190 --> 00:16:02.850
then I'll worry about myself.

00:16:03.920 --> 00:16:05.890
You don't have to waste your time with us.

00:16:06.230 --> 00:16:09.530
She's right. Lisa, you're the one
who's sacrificing the most here.

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:15.430
Let's hurry and get going.

00:16:18.310 --> 00:16:19.200
Knave!

00:16:20.210 --> 00:16:21.230
It's the enemy.

00:16:21.810 --> 00:16:22.710
They're coming down!

00:16:23.180 --> 00:16:24.240
What?!

00:16:35.860 --> 00:16:37.150
Everyone, this way!

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:39.460
Mr. Knave!

00:16:39.460 --> 00:16:40.520
Good luck!

00:16:46.430 --> 00:16:47.660
He's right above us.

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:53.930
Ai! Yu!

00:17:03.680 --> 00:17:05.650
Ai! Yu!

00:17:06.650 --> 00:17:09.210
Ai! Yu!

00:17:20.330 --> 00:17:21.600
That's the...

00:18:07.210 --> 00:18:09.580
Ai! Yu! Hang in there!

00:18:10.380 --> 00:18:11.440
You, too...

00:18:12.120 --> 00:18:15.180
You've come here from
another world, haven't you?!

00:18:17.020 --> 00:18:22.690
You are no match for the Earl.

00:18:40.610 --> 00:18:43.850
I have been searching for you.

00:18:44.950 --> 00:18:47.440
Why did you...

00:18:51.890 --> 00:18:53.920
Awaken?

00:19:02.000 --> 00:19:03.900
Stop it! Cease fire!

00:19:04.270 --> 00:19:08.370
These people... Don't get the
Comodeen's ideals involved in this!

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:10.670
I know nothing of ideals.

00:19:11.980 --> 00:19:14.410
As long as I get to finish things with him,

00:19:15.780 --> 00:19:21.580
I could care less about what happens to
the world, or how many people die!

00:19:22.720 --> 00:19:25.090
And you call yourself human?!

00:19:33.670 --> 00:19:35.730
Kaze...

00:19:36.700 --> 00:19:39.000
Soil is my power!

00:19:45.250 --> 00:19:49.440
Impressive as ever, Black Wind.

00:19:51.520 --> 00:19:54.920
Embraced by the magical tune
played by the Mist...

00:19:56.360 --> 00:19:57.520
Now sleep!

00:20:02.500 --> 00:20:04.360
Silver Etude!

00:20:53.910 --> 00:20:55.650
I am so thirsty

00:20:53.910 --> 00:20:55.650
Nodo ga karakara desu

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:57.020
It's really getting bad

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:57.020
Taihen nan desu

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:59.140
It's burning up inside of me

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:59.140
Kono mune ookaji desu

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:02.490
My heart skipped a beat

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:02.490
Kimi wo hitome mita

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:05.390
When I laid eyes on you

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:05.390
Shunkan bibi tto kita

00:21:05.390 --> 00:21:07.060
It's just like torture

00:21:05.390 --> 00:21:07.060
Goumon no you desu

00:21:07.060 --> 00:21:08.500
I can't take it

00:21:07.060 --> 00:21:08.500
Taekirenai desu

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:10.520
Ever since I fell in love with you

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:10.520
Kimi ni koi shite kara

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:13.970
My heart skips a beat whenever

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:13.970
Itsumo kimi to nita

00:21:13.970 --> 00:21:16.490
I see a girl with hair like yours

00:21:13.970 --> 00:21:16.490
Kamigata ni ha to suru

00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:20.570
Please, God

00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:20.570
Douka kamisama

00:21:20.570 --> 00:21:24.880
Can you please give me wings?

00:21:20.570 --> 00:21:24.880
Kono boku ni tsubasa kudasai yo

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:28.420
From now on, my thoughts of you

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:28.420
Kore kare kimi dake wo motto tsuyoku

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:31.040
Will only shine and grow stronger

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:31.040
Omotchatte kirakira

00:21:31.250 --> 00:21:34.050
There's so much I want to tell you

00:21:31.250 --> 00:21:34.050
Tsutaetai koto ippai

00:21:34.050 --> 00:21:37.060
There's not enough time left in the world

00:21:34.050 --> 00:21:37.060
Jikan ga tarinai nai ai ai

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:39.890
You are now the only person

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:39.890
Boku no hitomi ni wa mou

00:21:39.890 --> 00:21:42.230
That my eyes can see

00:21:39.890 --> 00:21:42.230
Kimi shika utsuranai

00:21:42.230 --> 00:21:44.930
Now I've got my hopes set high

00:21:42.230 --> 00:21:44.930
Kitai wa kore kara

00:21:44.930 --> 00:21:48.140
All of these thoughts are too much for me

00:21:44.930 --> 00:21:48.140
Nani kara nani made omoikitchatte

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:51.070
So I'm just going to spill my guts

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:51.070
Sa subete wo butsukeyou

00:21:51.170 --> 00:21:57.040
Nobody knows the right answer

00:21:51.170 --> 00:21:57.040
Seikai wa dare ni mo wakanai ai ai ai ai

00:21:57.040 --> 00:21:59.850
I'm already celebrating my joy

00:21:57.040 --> 00:21:59.850
Atama no naka de wa mou

00:21:59.850 --> 00:22:02.220
On the inside

00:21:59.850 --> 00:22:02.220
Shukufuku no kurakkaa

00:22:02.220 --> 00:22:05.190
Something is going to start

00:22:02.220 --> 00:22:05.190
Nani ka ga hajimaru

00:22:05.190 --> 00:22:07.920
Now I've got my hopes set high

00:22:05.190 --> 00:22:07.920
Kitai wa kore kara

00:22:07.920 --> 00:22:12.030
Let's never lose sight of our dreams

00:22:07.920 --> 00:22:12.030
Nozomi wo mochimashou

00:22:12.030 --> 00:22:13.390
All right!

00:22:12.030 --> 00:22:13.390
All right!

00:22:16.630 --> 00:22:19.530
Final Fantasy: Unlimited

00:22:23.200 --> 00:22:24.760
Here is my prophecy.

00:22:26.170 --> 00:22:30.510
The lost travelers continue their journey
as they chase after the Subway.

00:22:31.450 --> 00:22:35.010
But a horrible enemy waits in their path.

00:22:41.150 --> 00:22:43.920
Next time, I will return to offer you
my Unlimited guidance.
